=2 Walkthrough
* First head to {z:Rabao} and talk to {n:Rudolfo} (J-7).
* Talk to {n:Zoriboh} (F-6).
* Head to {z:Norg} and talk to {n:Sohyon} (J-8).
* Then talk to {n:Washu} to receive the {p:Key Item}: {@k} {k:Washu's flask}.
* Head to {z:Korroloka Tunnel}. You will need to fill the flask by interacting with four different **Giant Clam** targets.
** The first **Giant Clam** can be found at F-10 on Map 1 as you zone into {z:Korroloka Tunnel} from {z:Zeruhn Mines}.
** The second **Giant Clam** can be found at K-6 on Map 3.
** The third **Giant Clam** can be found at G-11 on Map 5.
** The final **Giant Clam** can be found at I-10 on Map 2.
** After examining all four **Giant Clams**, your {@k} {k:Washu's flask} will turn into a {@k} {k:Flask of clam water}.
* Head to {z:Norg} and talk to {n:Sohyon} (J-8) to receive the {@k} {k:Storeroom key}.
* Talk to {n:Gimb} (H-9).
* Head to {z:Port Bastok} and talk to {p:Kagetora} (F-6).
* Trade 5x {@i:Eastern Gem|1664} {i:Eastern Gem|Eastern Gem|1664}s to {n:Patient Wheel} (F-5).
** These drop from {m:Riparian Sahagin} behind the silver door in {z:Sea Serpent Grotto}.
* Head to {z:Selbina} and talk to {n:Abelard} at G-9).
* Use the {n:Swirling Vortex} in {z:Valkurm Dunes} in the cave at (I-9) to {z:Lufaise Meadows}.
* You will get a cut scene when you zone into {z:Lufaise Meadows}.
* Head to {z:Rabao}, talk to {n:Zoriboh} (F-6).

